%
% This is file `ufca.ins'.
%
% Roda o docstrip sobre `ufca.dtx' e gera a classe `ufca.cls' e o
% estilo de makeindex `ufca.ist'.
%
% Gere com LuaTeX, para que os caracteres acentuados dos textos fixos
% da classe sejam preservados:
%
%     luatex ufca.ins
%
% (Com `tex' ou `pdftex' a geracao tambem funciona, mas os acentos
% saem escritos na notacao ^^xx, ilegivel embora equivalente.)
%
% Copyright (C) 2020-2026 Vicente Helano
%
% This program is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify
% it under the terms of the GNU General Public License version 3 as
% published by the Free Software Foundation.
%
% This program is distributed in the hope that it will be useful,
% but WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY; without even the implied warranty of
% MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE. See the
% GNU General Public License version 3 for more details.
%
% You should have received a copy of the GNU General Public License
% version 3 along with this package. If not, see
% <http://www.gnu.org/licenses/>.
%
% Author(s): Vicente Helano
%

\input docstrip

\keepsilent
\askforoverwritefalse

\preamble

Classe LaTeX para trabalhos academicos (TCCs, dissertacoes e teses) da
Universidade Federal do Cariri (UFCA), em conformidade com as normas
da ABNT e com o manual de normalizacao da Biblioteca da UFCA.

Este arquivo foi gerado a partir de ufca.dtx; nao o edite
diretamente. Para alterar a classe, edite ufca.dtx e regenere com

    luatex ufca.ins

Copyright (C) 2020-2026 Vicente Helano

This program is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify
it under the terms of the GNU General Public License version 3 as
published by the Free Software Foundation.

This program is distributed in the hope that it will be useful,
but WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY; without even the implied warranty of
MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE. See the
GNU General Public License version 3 for more details.

You should have received a copy of the GNU General Public License
version 3 along with this package. If not, see
<http://www.gnu.org/licenses/>.

Author(s): Vicente Helano

\endpreamble

\generate{%
  \file{ufca.cls}{\from{ufca.dtx}{class}}%
  \file{ufca.ist}{\from{ufca.dtx}{glossary}}%
}

\obeyspaces
\Msg{*************************************************************}
\Msg{*                                                           *}
\Msg{* Para concluir a instalacao, mova os arquivos gerados       *}
\Msg{*                                                           *}
\Msg{*     ufca.cls  ufca.ist                                    *}
\Msg{*                                                           *}
\Msg{* para um diretorio lido pelo TeX, ou para a pasta do seu   *}
\Msg{* trabalho. A documentacao se obtem com                     *}
\Msg{*                                                           *}
\Msg{*     pdflatex ufca.dtx                                     *}
\Msg{*                                                           *}
\Msg{*************************************************************}

\endbatchfile
